msgid "Hide the White Label settings menu"
msgstr "Nascondi il menu delle impostazioni di White Label"

#: lib/views/white_label/settings.php:140
msgid "When enabled, the White Label menu item is removed from the admin sidebar. To restore it, deactivate and reactivate the LatePoint Pro Features plugin."
